<section class="vc-page-actions"><div><span class="vc-status info" id="vcom-status">Loading customer activity…</span></div><button type="button" class="vc-btn" id="vcom-read-all">Mark notifications read</button></section>
<div class="vc-grid two"><section class="vc-card" id="notifications"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Notifications</h2></div><div class="vc-card-body vc-list" id="vcom-notifications">Loading…</div></section><section class="vc-card"><div class="vc-card-head"><h2>Product reviews</h2></div><div class="vc-card-body vc-list" id="vcom-reviews">Loading…</div></section></div>
<p class="vc-help mt-3">Customer support conversations are handled through order-specific support tickets. Direct messaging and product questions are not available in this build.</p>
<dialog class="vc-dialog" id="vcom-dialog"><div class="vc-dialog-head"><h2>Reply to review</h2><button type="button" class="vc-btn small" id="vcom-close">Close</button></div><form class="vc-dialog-body" id="vcom-form"><input type="hidden" name="review_id"><div class="vc-field"><label>Your public reply</label><textarea class="vc-textarea" name="reply" required minlength="10" maxlength="2000" rows="5"></textarea></div><div class="vc-form-actions"><button class="vc-btn primary" type="submit">Publish reply</button></div></form></dialog>
